Z||000006||Pontiaddict||04-02-2001||06:59 PM||||On the chat, I forgot to mention to you that you had to remove the parking light wire from the amber light socket. But since you used new sockets anyway, you didn't have to worry about the turn signals coming on with the headlights (since they also doulbed as parking lights in the coupe harness).<P>Glad to hear it worked though, good job!||||reg||1
